{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#card-zh","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 为 AI agent 提供持久记忆。DSH bundle 挂载 dsh-mnemon npm 插件并设置 guided recall、writeback 和生命周期选项；插件运行时代码来自外部包。仓库内的 Go CLI 将 insight 存入本地 SQLite，支持图关系、关键词与意图感知召回、草稿导入、记忆链接和软删除。可选 Ollama 或 OpenAI-compatible embedding 服务增强检索；本地记忆无需 API key。适合需要跨会话保留事实与决策的 agent 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-16","cmd/memory/remember.go:29-49","cmd/memory/recall.go:29-45","internal/memory/graph/engine.go:63-80"]}
{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#card-en","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Mnemon gives agents persistent memory. Its DSH bundle mounts an external dsh-mnemon npm plugin with guided recall and writeback settings. The Go CLI stores insights in local SQLite, links related memories, and supports keyword and intent-aware recall plus draft imports. Embeddings are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-16","cmd/memory/remember.go:29-49","cmd/memory/recall.go:29-45","internal/memory/graph/engine.go:63-80"]}
