{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#feature-remember","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 的功能「保存记忆」：将文本作为 insight 写入本地记忆库，可附类别、重要度、标签和实体，并生成图关系；重复内容会按精确匹配处理。通过 `mnemon remember` 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["cmd/memory/remember.go:29-49","internal/memory/graph/engine.go:63-80"]}
{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#feature-recall","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 的功能「意图感知召回」：根据查询意图组合关键词、实体、相似度和图信号排序记忆，并输出紧凑结果、置信度与匹配信息。通过 `mnemon recall` 触发，可指定意图、过滤条件或简短摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["cmd/memory/recall.go:29-45","internal/memory/search/recall.go:64-75"]}
{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#feature-search","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 的功能「关键词检索」：对记忆内容进行 token 化关键词评分并按相关性排序，可设置结果上限或返回短摘要。通过 `mnemon search` 输入查询触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["cmd/memory/search.go:19-25","cmd/memory/search.go:39-63"]}
{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#feature-import","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 的功能「批量导入」：读取并验证记忆草稿 JSON，可先 dry-run 校验；正式导入时沿用写入路径处理去重、图关系和 embedding。通过 `mnemon import <file>` 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["cmd/memory/import.go:24-55"]}
{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#feature-bundle","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 的功能「DSH 挂载配置」：bundle 插入 `dsh-mnemon` 插件行，并提供 guided recall/writeback、生命周期、闲置复查、写入开关、超时和默认召回上限配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-16"]}
{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#caveat-runtime","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 的 DSH bundle 引用 npm 依赖 `dsh-mnemon@latest`，该依赖实现不包含在此提交；仓库内能直接核实的是挂载行和默认配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:1-21","cordis.patch.yml:1-16"]}
{"unit_id":"mnemon-dev__mnemon#caveat-embedding","repo":"mnemon-dev/mnemon","commit":"bbc9151234e0c4f563a0d581e4bc2d5a2d4f83ec","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Mnemon 的 embedding 客户端默认连接本机 Ollama，也可配置 OpenAI-compatible endpoint；需要 embedding 时可提供 MNEMON_EMBED_API_KEY，具体配置由环境变量读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["internal/memory/embed/ollama.go:17-37","internal/memory/embed/ollama.go:51-67"]}
